title: Whiteboard
description: The canvas (React Flow). Nodes, text nodes, nestable groups, and styled edges. Any of them can hold a page of notes or a whole whiteboard of its own.
connects:
  - to: src/lib/whiteboard
    label: reads and writes the board
  - to: src/lib/sync
    label: live updates and cursors
  - to: src/components/editor
    label: notes in the side panel
